  "description": "See how Blackmagic Design supports Apple Immersive Video through an end-to-end workflow, from the URSA Cine Immersive camera to immersive tools in DaVinci Resolve Studio 20. Learn how features support reviewing preview content on Apple Vision Pro, mixing in Spatial Audio, managing camera motion data, and delivery of final bundles using purpose-built presets. This session was originally presented as part of the Meet with Apple activity “Create immersive media experiences for visionOS - Day 2.” Watch the full video for more insights and related sessions.",
